# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the placeholder team. With branch protection's
# "Require review from Code Owners", a change that loosens a gate (ratchet config or baseline,
# budget manifest, the checks themselves, standing instructions, the workflow that runs them)
# needs an owner's approval, even when an agent wrote it.
/scripts/governance/                 @your-org/governance-owners
/AGENTS.md                           @your-org/governance-owners
/CLAUDE.md                           @your-org/governance-owners
/.github/workflows/governance.yml    @your-org/governance-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS                  @your-org/governance-owners
